<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>تسجيل الدخول | OD Book</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .login-container {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .login-container .logo {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .login-container .logo span {
            color: var(--main-orange);
        }

        .login-container h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .login-container p {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .input-group {
            text-align: right;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .input-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .input-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 15px;
            border: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-family: 'Cairo';
            font-size: 15px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            background: #fafafa;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            border-color: var(--main-orange);
            background: #fff;
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .error-banner {
            background: #ffebee;
            color: #c62828;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: var(--main-orange);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 800;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .login-footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .login-footer a {
            color: var(--main-orange);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .back-home {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/" class="back-home"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> العودة للرئيسية</a>

    <div class="login-container">
        <a href="/" class="logo">OD <span>Book</span></a>
        <h2>أهلاً بك مجدداً</h2>
        <p>سجل دخولك لتستمتع بمكتبتنا الصوتية</p>

        <% if (locals.error) { %>
            <div class="error-banner">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i>
                <%= error %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <form action="/login" method="POST">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>اسم المستخدم</label>
                <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="أدخل اسمك أو بريدك" required>
            </div>

            <div class="input-group">
                <label>كلمة السر</label>
                <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">دخول</button>
        </form>

        <div class="login-footer">
            ليس لديك حساب؟ <a href="/register">اشترك الآن مجاناً</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>